<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended lower in moderate trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 18.54 to 7274.21.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.60 to 433.97.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.15.</p>
<p>Winners were outnumbered by losers 1135 to 1325.</p>
<p>Volume was 489,701,900, compared with 459,008,710 on Monday.</p>
